      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Running wild——只凭着性子猛冲，是赢不了的。\nNot just against me……对所有人，都是如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "848953a90e4a75882e678a1b95fd0fdff51761e72508513f219cb4a9461a4758",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
