    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45daeda46b90767c2860bfdc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神威启示正和刚刚才击败她的吉兆\n一起进行训练。……与其这么说，不如说是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0b78bcd2323029da646774ccb94740b7644c3c0fc851937e1fd403268fe7e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1141/storytimeline_041141003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb426a4060787c73fc11b042",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……她是在单方面地紧跟不舍吗？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a1094693f7a1b574300803137e021feaf582457ab21833ccfa3f6d0ce892ded",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1141/storytimeline_041141003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
