    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ca23f029a90b8a131c9de7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这应该不仅仅是单方面的情感。训练员你，\n也是因为感觉到了什么，才站在这里的吧？……直到现在也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88bc85f55c4ae55a0eff895d542818832f640cef5070d4350d386c07fe0a6f3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1141/storytimeline_041141003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
